TYPE tau_I
TYPE tau_A
TYPE tau_V

ENTITY I0
QUALIFY I0 type tau_I

ENTITY I1
QUALIFY I1 type tau_I

ENTITY I2
QUALIFY I2 type tau_I

POSITION_NEXT I0 I1
POSITION_NEXT I1 I2

ENTITY A3
QUALIFY A3 type tau_A

ENTITY A5
QUALIFY A5 type tau_A

ENTITY A1
QUALIFY A1 type tau_A

ENTITY V6
QUALIFY V6 type tau_V

ENTITY V4
QUALIFY V4 type tau_V

ENTITY V3
QUALIFY V3 type tau_V

PAIR A3V6 A3 V6
QUALIFY A3V6 type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)

PAIR A5V4 A5 V4
QUALIFY A5V4 type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)

PAIR A1V3 A1 V3
QUALIFY A1V3 type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)

ENTITY CXE2T2
QUALIFY CXE2T2 kind context
QUALIFY CXE2T2 type tau_CX
QUALIFY CXE2T2 base_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CXE2T2 distinguishes_type Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
QUALIFY CXE2T2 member A3V6
QUALIFY CXE2T2 member A5V4
QUALIFY CXE2T2 member A1V3

ENTITY U1
QUALIFY U1 kind stream
QUALIFY U1 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U1 I0 A3V6
AT U1 I1 A5V4
AT U1 I2 A1V3

ENTITY U2
QUALIFY U2 kind stream
QUALIFY U2 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U2 I0 A5V4
AT U2 I1 A1V3
AT U2 I2 A3V6

ENTITY U3
QUALIFY U3 kind stream
QUALIFY U3 type Stream(Pair(tau_A,tau_V))
AT U3 I0 A1V3
AT U3 I1 A3V6

ENTITY E2T2
QUALIFY E2T2 kind task
QUALIFY E2T2 context CXE2T2
QUALIFY E2T2 input U1
QUALIFY E2T2 input U2
QUALIFY E2T2 input U3

UNKNOWN_AT E2T2 XE2T2 U3 I2 Pair(tau_A,tau_V)
